res = boundary retry 2 { return submit_result({ answer: { start: time.format(best.start), end: time.format(best.end) } }) } catch err { return fail("SUBMIT_FAILED", err.message) }
return { start: time.format(best.start), end: time.format(best.end), submitted: res.recorded }
```

